['Compare a Parabolic SAR exit with your current stop-management rule.', 'Filtered positions have their stop-losses trailed from Parabolic SAR. A chart button controls whether management is active.', 'Check the SAR-related inputs and target filters in the author version. On demo, compare each modification to the visible SAR and broker stop-distance constraints.', 'SAR can change sides as market conditions change. This manager does not assess whether an entry is appropriate. Check conflicts with other automated exits.'],
