['Study a moving-average channel breakout as an automated research example.', 'The project, adapted from an earlier MT4 EA by don_forex, uses two moving averages with the same period to form a channel and trades breakouts.', 'Compare the author’s MA source/method and channel setup before testing. In demo, inspect boundary touches separately from the actual entry condition.', 'The author warns of possible total loss. This listing links to the maintained source and its stated license; it is not a BSV code mirror or performance endorsement.'],
